they detect your presence, requiring quick decisions and strategic movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656550/extras/7cf06507f6a789812078976cbbfb4920.avif?t=1750883926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656550/extras_big/7cf06507f6a789812078976cbbfb4920.avif?t=1750883926 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay combines elements of action and survival, with a real-time perspective that puts the player in constant tension. As you explore the maze, you'll need to be agile, use the environment to your advantage, and watch out for dead-end entrances that can become fatal traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656550/extras/daa9ce1625ba8aba6e91a0e3b9cea0d7.avif?t=1750883926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656550/extras_big/daa9ce1625ba8aba6e91a0e3b9cea0d7.avif?t=1750883926 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick matches:</strong> Each game is up to 10 minutes long, ideal for short, intense sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic maze:</strong> face a labyrinthine scenario that requires attention and strategy to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent enemies:</strong> opponents who chase the player and react to their presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive solo experience:</strong> 100% singleplayer, focused on tension and personal challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape, or will you be another lost soul in this vast labyrinth?</p>","developers":["pixelartus"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656550/341383a8dc67e50ac6e257fd96df9ee8ca6508f2/header.jpg?t=1750883926","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3656550/1208874033/83d563864de8a2d14fc7dcb9a14278204b960c24/1750416430/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748686102","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3656550/1208874033/83d563864de8a2d14fc7dcb9a14278204b960c24/1750416430/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748686102","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3656550/1208874033/83d563864de8a2d14fc7dcb9a14278204b960c24/1750416430/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748686102","id":257142313,"name":"Claustromania trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142313/76d81d248ea90a61b2ea902231d43dcf2b128c5a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748686102"}],"name":"Claustromania","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Claustromania - $0.99 USD","packageid":1288402,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents